[00:02.36]1. Throughout our lifetime, We want to use each day
[00:11.82]To make a good name And all God’s laws obey.
[00:22.80]If in Jehovah’s sight We strive to do what’s right,
[00:32.48]Then we will please him, To his delight.
[00:41.24]2. This world may cause us To try to make a name,
[00:53.86]To seek its favor, To bask in its acclaim.
[01:04.28]But that is vanity, For if its friend we’ll be,
[01:14.12]Jehovah’s favor, We will not see.
[01:25.42]3. In God’s remembrance, We want our name to be
[01:35.98]And have a good name For all eternity.
[01:46.48]On him we can depend, So we his truth defend
[01:56.72]And keep our good name Down to the end.
